-- en: "Check whether you or your pet know this exact spell ID. An unlearned spell is a valid condition that returns false, so the same rotation can adapt as you learn abilities. This does not check cooldown, resources, range, or whether the spell can currently be cast. Missing or restricted learned-state data stays unavailable under NOT."
L["Check whether you or your pet know this exact spell ID. An unlearned spell is a valid condition that returns false, so the same rotation can adapt as you learn abilities. This does not check cooldown, resources, range, or whether the spell can currently be cast. Missing or restricted learned-state data stays unavailable under NOT."] = "检查你或你的宠物是否学会了这个确切的法术 ID。未学会的法术是有效条件，结果为假，因此同一个循环可以随着你学会技能而自动适应。它不检查冷却、资源、距离或该法术当前能否施放。缺失或受限的已学状态数据在 NOT 下仍为不可用。"
-- en: "Only consider auras that you applied yourself."
L["Only consider auras that you applied yourself."] = "仅考虑你自己施加的光环。"
-- en: "Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Remaining aura time is measured in seconds. Permanent auras have no expiration and do not satisfy a finite refresh threshold. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition. Restricted or unknown timing is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "光环剩余时间以秒为单位。永久光环没有到期时间，不满足有限的刷新阈值。不存在的光环不满足此条件。受限或未知的时间为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."
L["Compare the application count of a matching aura, including charges such as Earth Shield. An absent aura does not satisfy this condition; an unreadable count is unavailable."] = "比较匹配光环的叠加层数，包括如大地之盾这类的充能次数。不存在的光环不满足此条件；无法读取的层数为不可用。"
-- en: "Only consider debuffs returned by the game's dispellable aura filter. This does not guarantee your dispel is ready or in range."
L["Only consider debuffs returned by the game's dispellable aura filter. This does not guarantee your dispel is ready or in range."] = "仅考虑游戏的可驱散光环过滤器返回的减益效果。这并不保证你的驱散技能已就绪或在范围内。"
-- en: "With no off-hand weapon equipped, an off-hand check is false (and true under NOT)."
L["With no off-hand weapon equipped, an off-hand check is false (and true under NOT)."] = "没有装备副手武器时，副手检测为假（在 NOT 下为真）。"
-- en: "Uses the native Attack range check when available. Otherwise it uses LibRangeCheck's public interval to distinguish close range from beyond five yards; that estimate does not prove exact melee geometry for every target. An interval spanning the boundary, missing data or restricted data stays unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Uses the native Attack range check when available. Otherwise it uses LibRangeCheck's public interval to distinguish close range from beyond five yards; that estimate does not prove exact melee geometry for every target. An interval spanning the boundary, missing data or restricted data stays unavailable, including under NOT."] = "在可用时使用原生的“攻击”距离检查。否则使用 LibRangeCheck 的公开距离区间来区分近距离与五码以外；该估算并不能保证对每个目标都精确反映近战判定。跨越边界的区间、缺失数据或受限数据保持为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "recharge time on %s"
L["recharge time on %s"] = "%s的充能时间"
-- en: "Seconds until the next spell charge. Full charges and inactive recharge timers report zero. Missing, restricted, or non-charge spell data stays unavailable."
L["Seconds until the next spell charge. Full charges and inactive recharge timers report zero. Missing, restricted, or non-charge spell data stays unavailable."] = "距离下一次法术充能的秒数。充能已满或充能计时未运行时报告为零。缺失、受限或非充能法术的数据保持为不可用。"
-- en: "The elemental slot to check: Fire, Earth, Water or Air. Empty, zero-duration and expired totems do not match."
L["The elemental slot to check: Fire, Earth, Water or Air. Empty, zero-duration and expired totems do not match."] = "要检查的元素栏位：火焰、大地、水或空气。空的、持续时间为零的和已过期的图腾不匹配。"
-- en: "The active totem to check. Unticked, Use this exact spell rank matches its localized name across ranks. Ticked, it requires the native spell ID; name-only observations are unavailable."
L["The active totem to check. Unticked, Use this exact spell rank matches its localized name across ranks. Ticked, it requires the native spell ID; name-only observations are unavailable."] = "要检查的生效中图腾。未勾选“使用这个确切的法术等级”时，按其本地化名称匹配所有等级。勾选后需要原生法术 ID；仅有名称的观测为不可用。"
-- en: "Compare the active totem's remaining seconds with this amount. An absent or expired totem does not match; unavailable observations stay unavailable."
L["Compare the active totem's remaining seconds with this amount. An absent or expired totem does not match; unavailable observations stay unavailable."] = "将生效中图腾的剩余秒数与此数值进行比较。不存在或已过期的图腾不匹配；不可用的观测保持为不可用。"
-- en: "This reference belongs to another talent layout. Selecting a talent explicitly replaces it; viewing does not convert it."
L["This reference belongs to another talent layout. Selecting a talent explicitly replaces it; viewing does not convert it."] = "此引用属于另一种天赋布局。显式选择一个天赋会替换它；仅查看不会转换它。"
-- en: "Historical talent slot %s (unavailable)"
L["Historical talent slot %s (unavailable)"] = "历史天赋栏位 %s（不可用）"
-- en: "This client uses a different talent system. This reference is preserved but cannot be evaluated."
L["This client uses a different talent system. This reference is preserved but cannot be evaluated."] = "此客户端使用不同的天赋系统。此引用会被保留，但无法评估。"
-- en: "Classic conditions compare points spent in a tree talent. Mists selections use six tiers with three choices. Historical references from another talent system remain unavailable and are never automatically converted."
L["Classic conditions compare points spent in a tree talent. Mists selections use six tiers with three choices. Historical references from another talent system remain unavailable and are never automatically converted."] = "经典版条件比较投入在天赋树某个天赋上的点数。熊猫人之谜的天赋选择使用六个层级，每层三选一。来自其他天赋系统的历史引用保持为不可用，且永远不会被自动转换。"
-- en: "A form is chosen by its spell, so the condition keeps working as new forms are learned and on every client language. Any rank of the form matches. The list shows the forms on your stance bar, then your class's other forms on this client. A condition saved by stance bar slot keeps that slot until you choose a form. If the client cannot read the active form, the condition is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["A form is chosen by its spell, so the condition keeps working as new forms are learned and on every client language. Any rank of the form matches. The list shows the forms on your stance bar, then your class's other forms on this client. A condition saved by stance bar slot keeps that slot until you choose a form. If the client cannot read the active form, the condition is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "形态按其法术选择，因此随着学会新形态，该条件仍然有效，并且在所有客户端语言下都有效。形态的任何等级都会匹配。列表先显示姿态栏上的形态，再显示此客户端上你职业的其他形态。按姿态栏栏位保存的条件会保留该栏位，直到你选择一个形态。如果客户端无法读取当前形态，该条件不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Stance bar slot %s (%s)"
L["Stance bar slot %s (%s)"] = "姿态栏栏位 %s（%s）"
-- en: "%s cast progress"
L["%s cast progress"] = "%s 施法进度"
-- en: "%s channel progress"
L["%s channel progress"] = "%s 引导进度"
-- en: "Progress"
L["Progress"] = "进度"
-- en: "How much of the current cast of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it completes. It follows haste and pushback, because it is measured against the cast's own start and end. If the unit is not casting, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the cast's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["How much of the current cast of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it completes. It follows haste and pushback, because it is measured against the cast's own start and end. If the unit is not casting, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the cast's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "{unit} 当前施法完成了多少，从开始时的 0% 到完成时的 100%。它会随急速和施法推迟变化，因为它是相对于该次施法自身的开始和结束来衡量的。如果该单位没有在施法，则无论使用什么运算符，此条件都不成立；如果无法读取施法时间，则不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "How much of the current channel of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it ends. Ticks are evenly spaced through a channel, so tick N of a K-tick channel lands at N/K whatever your haste: to clip Mind Flay (3 ticks) after its second tick, use at least 66%. Pushback shortens a channel and the progress follows it. If the unit is not channeling, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the channel's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["How much of the current channel of {unit} is done, from 0% when it starts to 100% when it ends. Ticks are evenly spaced through a channel, so tick N of a K-tick channel lands at N/K whatever your haste: to clip Mind Flay (3 ticks) after its second tick, use at least 66%. Pushback shortens a channel and the progress follows it. If the unit is not channeling, this condition is not successful, whatever the operator; if the channel's times cannot be read, it is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "{unit} 当前引导完成了多少，从开始时的 0% 到结束时的 100%。跳数在引导过程中均匀分布，因此 K 跳引导的第 N 跳无论急速如何都落在 N/K：要在第二跳之后打断精神鞭笞（3 跳），请使用至少 66%。施法推迟会缩短引导，进度随之变化。如果该单位没有在引导，则无论使用什么运算符，此条件都不成立；如果无法读取引导时间，则不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Talent tree %s"
L["Talent tree %s"] = "天赋树 %s"
-- en: "This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."
L["This client does not expose a Classic talent-tree layout. The saved tree reference is preserved."] = "此客户端未提供经典版天赋树布局。已保存的天赋树引用会被保留。"
-- en: "Talent tree"
L["Talent tree"] = "天赋树"
-- en: "the number of points spent in %s"
L["the number of points spent in %s"] = "%s中投入的点数"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["Talent tree selects the Classic tree whose spent points are compared. Public points are read again on the next evaluation; missing or restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "“天赋树”选择要比较已投入点数的经典版天赋树。公开点数会在下一次评估时重新读取；缺失或受限的点数为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。不支持网格天赋和特质树。"
-- en: "Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."
L["Compare whole points spent from zero to 512. An explicit comparison with zero can describe an unspent tree."] = "比较已投入的整数点数，范围为 0 到 512。显式与零比较可用来描述未投点的天赋树。"
-- en: "Talent trees are named, never numbered: the list shows each tree by name, in the order the talent window shows them, for the class the rotation is for. Your own class takes the names the game gives its trees; another class's rotation uses Rotation Master's own list of that class's trees. The rotation saves the tree's position in that order, so it keeps its meaning when you share it."
L["Talent trees are named, never numbered: the list shows each tree by name, in the order the talent window shows them, for the class the rotation is for. Your own class takes the names the game gives its trees; another class's rotation uses Rotation Master's own list of that class's trees. The rotation saves the tree's position in that order, so it keeps its meaning when you share it."] = "天赋树以名称显示，而不是编号：列表按天赋窗口的顺序，为该轮换所针对的职业逐一显示各个天赋树的名称。你自己的职业使用游戏给其天赋树起的名称；其他职业的轮换则使用 Rotation Master 自带的该职业天赋树列表。轮换保存的是天赋树在该顺序中的位置，因此分享后含义不变。"
-- en: "Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Talent tree selects the unique Classic tree with the most positive spent points. Equal maxima, no spent points, missing records and restricted points are unavailable, including under NOT."] = "“天赋树”选择投入点数最多（且大于零）的唯一经典版天赋树。最大值相同、未投入点数、记录缺失和受限点数均为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."
L["The primary tree is derived from readable points, not the saved rotation slot. Hybrid builds may need tree-point or individual-talent conditions instead; the primary tree does not assign a tank or healer role. Grids and trait trees are unsupported."] = "主天赋树由可读的点数推算得出，而不是已保存的循环栏位。混合天赋配置可能需要改用天赋树点数或单个天赋条件；主天赋树不会指定坦克或治疗职责。不支持网格天赋和特质树。"
-- en: "Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Item sets are checked in priority order. Bag counts use the first carried candidate, not the sum. Availability, range and cooldown checks use the first carried or equipped candidate. Missing or restricted observations stay unavailable, including under NOT."] = "物品组按优先级顺序检查。背包数量使用第一个携带的候选物品，而不是总和。可用性、距离和冷却检查使用第一个携带或已装备的候选物品。缺失或受限的观测保持为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."
L["Item Available checks the required level and enabled item cooldown. An active cooldown qualifies only when it ends with the readable global cooldown. This condition does not bypass the action's implicit ownership, usability and range checks."] = "“物品可用”会检查所需等级和已启用的物品冷却。只有当冷却随可读的公共冷却一同结束时，正在进行的冷却才算符合。此条件不会绕过动作隐含的拥有、可用性和距离检查。"
