-- en: "Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."
L["Matches when the selected unit is dead or a ghost. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable, including under NOT. In a Via Macro announcement, choose Announcement target to follow the supplied unit."] = "当所选单位已死亡或处于灵魂状态时匹配。缺失或无法读取的单位为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。在“通过宏”的通报中，选择“通报目标”可跟随所提供的单位。"
-- en: "Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."
L["Matches when the game reports the selected unit as friendly to you. This does not imply party or raid membership. A missing or unreadable unit is unavailable."] = "当游戏报告所选单位对你友好时匹配。这并不意味着它是小队或团队成员。缺失或无法读取的单位为不可用。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} suggesting a spell"] = "战斗辅助{{!正在|没有}}建议法术"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"
L["Assisted Combat {{!suggests|does not suggest}} %s"] = "战斗辅助{{!建议|不建议}}%s"
-- en: "Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."
L["Matches when Blizzard's Assisted Combat suggests this spell as the next cast. An override counts as its base spell, and the base spell as its override. With no spell chosen, matches whenever Assisted Combat suggests anything."] = "当暴雪的战斗辅助建议将此法术作为下一个施放的法术时匹配。覆盖法术视为其基础法术，基础法术也视为其覆盖法术。未选择法术时，只要战斗辅助有任何建议就匹配。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["Assisted Combat exists on Retail (and is declared on Forever). Where the game does not offer it, for this character or specialization, or the suggestion cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "战斗辅助存在于正式服（并在永久服中声明）。若游戏未为此角色或专精提供该功能，或无法读取建议，此条件为不可用而非假，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"
L["%s {{!is|is not}} in Blizzard's Assisted Combat rotation"] = "%s {{!在|不在}}暴雪战斗辅助的循环中"
-- en: "Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."
L["Matches when this spell is one Blizzard's Assisted Combat can suggest for your current specialization. Its current override and its base spell count too. Use it to highlight what Assisted Combat leaves out, for example a cooldown that is not in the set."] = "当该法术是暴雪战斗辅助可以为你当前专精建议的法术之一时匹配。它当前的替换法术和基础法术也算。用它来高亮战斗辅助遗漏的内容，例如不在该集合中的冷却。"
-- en: "The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."
L["The set is read again whenever your spells change, never guessed. Where the game does not offer Assisted Combat for this character or specialization, or the set cannot be read, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT."] = "该集合在你的法术每次改变时都会重新读取，绝不猜测。如果游戏没有为此角色或专精提供战斗辅助，或无法读取该集合，则此条件不可用而不是为假，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"
L["Assisted Combat {{!is|is not}} available"] = "战斗辅助{{!可用|不可用}}"
-- en: "Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."
L["Matches when the game offers Blizzard's Assisted Combat for your character and current specialization. When it does not (for example a specialization Blizzard has no Assisted Combat rotation for, or a client that declares the API but does not offer the feature), this is false, so a branch can fall back to your own steps."] = "当游戏为你的角色和当前专精提供暴雪战斗辅助时匹配。不提供时（例如暴雪没有战斗辅助循环的专精，或声明了 API 却不提供该功能的客户端），结果为假，因此分支可以退回到你自己的步骤。"
-- en: "Unavailable only where the client has no Assisted Combat API or its answer cannot be read, including under NOT."
L["Unavailable only where the client has no Assisted Combat API or its answer cannot be read, including under NOT."] = "仅当客户端没有战斗辅助 API 或无法读取其应答时才不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
