L["Matches when a Season of Discovery rune is engraved on one of your equipped items. Passive runes count too, which a known-spell test cannot see."] = "当探索赛季的符文铭刻在你装备的某件物品上时匹配。被动符文也算，这是已知法术检测看不到的。"
