L["Engraving exists only on Season of Discovery realms. Elsewhere, and until your runes have loaded after logging in, this condition is unavailable rather than false, including under NOT. The Phase 7 shoulder runes are not engravings and are not seen. This is not the Death Knight Rune condition."] = "铭刻只存在于探索赛季服务器。在其他情况下，以及登录后你的符文加载完成之前，此条件不可用而不是为假，在 NOT 下同样如此。第七阶段的肩部符文不是铭刻，不会被识别。这不是死亡骑士的符文条件。"
