-- en: "Retail and Forever compare the rank of a talent in your active loadout. Pick it from the talents of the rotation's specialization (the Specialization list shows another specialization's, outside combat), or enter the node ID (and, for a choice node, the entry ID of the choice) to share a rotation. A choice node's entry has rank zero unless it is the chosen one, a hero talent outside your chosen hero tree has rank zero, and so does a talent of a specialization you are not playing. A talent picked from the list also remembers its spell, and is found again by it if Blizzard renumbers the talent tree. Ranks are read again after any talent change; an unreadable node is unavailable, including under NOT."
L["Retail and Forever compare the rank of a talent in your active loadout. Pick it from the talents of the rotation's specialization (the Specialization list shows another specialization's, outside combat), or enter the node ID (and, for a choice node, the entry ID of the choice) to share a rotation. A choice node's entry has rank zero unless it is the chosen one, a hero talent outside your chosen hero tree has rank zero, and so does a talent of a specialization you are not playing. A talent picked from the list also remembers its spell, and is found again by it if Blizzard renumbers the talent tree. Ranks are read again after any talent change; an unreadable node is unavailable, including under NOT."] = "正式服与 Forever 会比较你当前配置中某个天赋的等级。请从该循环所属专精的天赋中选择（“专精”列表可在战斗之外显示其他专精的天赋），或输入节点 ID（选择节点还需输入所选项的条目 ID）以分享循环。选择节点中未被选中的条目等级为零；你所选英雄天赋树之外的英雄天赋等级为零，你当前未使用的专精的天赋也是如此。从列表中选取的天赋还会记住其法术，当暴雪重新编号天赋树时可凭法术重新找到它。每次天赋变动后都会重新读取等级；无法读取的节点视为不可用，在 NOT 下同样如此。"
-- en: "Talents of another specialization cannot be loaded during combat. A node ID entered below is kept and evaluated."
L["Talents of another specialization cannot be loaded during combat. A node ID entered below is kept and evaluated."] = "无法在战斗中加载其他专精的天赋。下方输入的节点 ID 会被保留并参与判断。"
-- en: "Opens the talent tree of the rotation's specialization. Click a talent to choose it for this condition."
L["Opens the talent tree of the rotation's specialization. Click a talent to choose it for this condition."] = "打开该轮换专精的天赋树。点击一个天赋，即可为此条件选择它。"
-- en: "Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."
L["Show talent tree draws the talent tree of the specialization shown, with every talent open to choose. Click a talent to choose it, or click the chosen one again to clear it; the Talent list follows. It cannot open during combat."] = "“显示天赋树”会绘制所示专精的天赋树，所有天赋均可选择。点击一个天赋即可选择，再次点击已选天赋即可清除；天赋列表会随之更新。战斗中无法打开。"
-- en: "Forever is the exception: Talent tree is one of the three talent trees of your active loadout (in the order the talent window shows them); their points are read again after any talent change. Retail has no such trees."
L["Forever is the exception: Talent tree is one of the three talent trees of your active loadout (in the order the talent window shows them); their points are read again after any talent change. Retail has no such trees."] = "永久服是例外：天赋树是你当前激活配置的三棵天赋树之一（按天赋窗口显示的顺序）；它们的点数会在任何天赋改变后重新读取。正式服没有这样的天赋树。"
